{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a cold, blood-stained prison cell with no memory of how you got there but the screams echoing through the halls make one thing clear: you need to escape!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1744698231\" /><br><br> Explore the twisted depths of the\u00a0Virexon Pharmaceuticals research facility, where failed experiments roam and dark secrets lurk behind every locked door.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1744698231\" /><br> Face relentless hordes of the undead, terrifying bosses, and cryptic puzzles standing between you and freedom. Survive the nightmare alone or team up with up to 3 friends in intense online co-op. Will you uncover the truth or become part of the experiment?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1744698231\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656570?t=1744698231","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/4249884b11e67eed509a57e7be1f750c4a4359b2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744698231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/4299b9cbf039ab8cb0f6818011f7844d24ec87b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744698231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656570/4299b9cbf039ab8cb0f6818011f7844d24ec87b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744698231","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains violence and gore such as blood and dismemberment.\r\n\r\nAlso